          "text": "UBAI 吳(武)拜, d. 1665, age 70 (sui), belonged to the Gūwalgiya clan and was attached to the Plain White Banner. His father, Urikan 武理堪, was in the service of Nurhaci [q. v.] for many years as captain of one of the companies (niru) of Banner troops.",
